  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n・Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n・Pattern: Xを{差|さ}し{伸|の}べる\n\nFORMATION:\nCompound verb: {差|さ}す (to extend) + {伸|の}べる (to stretch)\n\n・{差|さ}し{伸|の}べる → {差|さ}し{伸|の}べない (negative)\n・{差|さ}し{伸|の}べる → {差|さ}し{伸|の}べて (te-form)\n・{差|さ}し{伸|の}べる → {差|さ}し{伸|の}べた (past)\n\nCOLLOCATIONS:\n・{手|て}を{差|さ}し{伸|の}べる - to extend one's hand\n・{救|すく}いの{手|て}を{差|さ}し{伸|の}べる - to extend a helping hand\n・{支援|しえん}の{手|て}を{差|さ}し{伸|の}べる - to offer support\n\nREGISTER:\nSlightly formal; often used in contexts involving aid, charity, or compassionate gestures.",
